<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Alusuisse.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Alusuisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland (Zurich) said it had issued 10 million American-style call warrants on Alusuisse shares.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1000 CHF		  PREMIUM	10.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.00 CHF		  GEARING	12.1 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  976 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
